# twin: render_one
# vulkan/negotiate_v1 with a core whose application info asks for Vulkan
# 1.0 and whose create_device still calls vkGetPhysicalDeviceProperties2,
# a 1.1 entry point, as Dolphin's does: the harness makes the instance for
# 1.1 where the loader has it, as RetroArch does, or the validation layer
# reports the call.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate v1
option 0 link_test_vk_api 1.0
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
